15. Acquired Immune Deficiency Syndrome (AIDS) and all Illnesses or diseases caused
by or related to the Human Immuno-deficiency Virus;
16. Sexually transmitted diseases;
17. Cosmetic or plastic Surgery except to the extent that such Surgery is necessary for
the repair of damage caused solely by Accidental Injuries; treatment of xanthelesema,
syringoma, acne and alopecia;
18. Nuclear disaster, radioactive contamination and/or release of nuclear or atomic
energy;
